B.acL=s(['Groups on Home can be put in your own order: hold a group \u2192 "Order of groups".',"A REPort in the log shows how many comments it has.","A member's photo opens in full with a tap on their card.","A voice shows how much is left, and its bars no longer squeeze.","Results open on the day, the chart on 7 days.","The notification's icon is a plus or a minus, no extra picture.","Reason hints stay out of the way: a rare one shows once two letters are typed.","In the web version the main sign-in button is the one that works for everyone."],t.s)
